1
00:00:00,588 --> 00:00:03,828
(Penny:)Well, I might not have
asked you to dance then,

2
00:00:03,825 --> 00:00:06,095
(Penny:)but I will ask you now.
There's no music.

3
00:00:06,094 --> 00:00:07,394
(Howard:)I don't care.

4
00:00:07,395 --> 00:00:08,665
(Penny:)We'll make
our own music.

5
00:00:08,663 --> 00:00:10,663
(Leonard:)My God, who's the dork now?

6
00:00:10,665 --> 00:00:11,735
(scoffs)

7
00:00:12,734 --> 00:00:14,804
(giggles)

8
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:21,170
(Leonard:)Thank you for
wearing your flats.

9
00:00:21,176 --> 00:00:23,006
(Leonard:)Thank you for
wearing your heels.

10
00:00:25,647 --> 00:00:27,077
Mmm.

11
00:00:27,082 --> 00:00:28,512
(Leonard:)Look at me.

12
00:00:28,516 --> 00:00:31,916
(Leonard:)Dancing with the prettiest
girl at the prom.

13
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,990
(Penny:)Want to take a picture
of us and send it

14
00:00:33,989 --> 00:00:36,659
(Penny:)to your old friends
in the chess club?

15
00:00:36,658 --> 00:00:39,258
(Leonard:)I sent them a bikini shot
of you years ago.

16
00:00:42,664 --> 00:00:44,994
(Leonard:)This is nice.

17
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,130
(Leonard:)I kind of wish
no one else was coming.

18
00:00:47,135 --> 00:00:50,035
(Penny:)I know, me, too.

19
00:00:50,038 --> 00:00:53,878
(Penny:)But it will be fun to have a
prom without all the drama.

20
00:00:57,045 --> 00:00:58,475
Howie, get off of him!

